    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2378_9117.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unßern freuendtlichen und geneigten willen
<lb n="2"/>zuovor, Fromme Ehrsame und weyße,
<lb n="3"/>inßonders lieben Herren, gueten Freuend und
<lb n="4"/>Eydtgnoßen.
<lb n="5"/>Vor uns ist erschinen, unßer angehoeriger
<lb n="6"/>burger und Metzger <persName resp="#ner">Othmar Abbtzeller</persName>,
<lb n="7"/>gehorßamlich fuerbringende, Dem-
<lb n="8"/>nach er mit <persName resp="#ner">Hannß Schueggenberger</persName>, Vogt
<lb n="9"/><persName resp="#ner">Gothfrid</persName> im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-64" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Rheinthal</placeName> euwerm
<lb n="10"/>Ambtsangehoerigen, in gegenwuert ehr-
<lb n="11"/>licher leueten, in unßerer Statt alhie, einen korn contract getroffen,
<lb n="12"/>und beschloßen, darinnen er ihme einen
<lb n="13"/>stich <persName resp="#ner">Kalbshaeller</persName> biß nechstkomende O-
<lb n="14"/>steren zu kauffen gegeben habe, den-
<lb n="15"/>selben zubezahlen mit solcher muentz und
<lb n="16"/>waehrung, wie sie demzuemal alhie
<lb n="17"/>gaeng und gaeb sein werde, Nun
<lb n="18"/>welle aber bemelter <persName resp="#ner">Schueggenberger</persName>,
<lb n="19"/>wegen gegenwuertigie schwebenden und
<lb n="20"/>bevorstenden muentzaenderung angeregten dißen
<lb n="21"/>contract hindersich gehen, und nit halten,
<lb n="22"/>mit underthenigem pitten, wir wellen
<lb n="23"/>ihme mit unßerer fuergschrifft an die
<lb n="24"/>Herren huelffliche hand bieten. Da-
<lb n="25"/>mit er moechte bey getroffnem kauff
<lb n="26"/>gehandhabet werden.
<lb n="27"/>Wan dan wir wol nein nit an deß
<lb n="28"/>Herren gueten justici gemeß keinen zweifel
<lb n="29"/>tragen, Nichts deß weeniger haben
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2378_9118.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="30"/>wir dem <persName resp="#ner">Vechwyler</persName> die gebettne
<lb n="31"/>intercession nit verwaigren wellen.
<lb n="32"/>Den Herren hierauf freündtlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">flißi</unclear>-
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gists</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuchend</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ambts</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angehoerigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soviul</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oberkeitlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zhandlen</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vechwyler</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halte</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">was</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwüschet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear> contrahiert worden,
<lb n="37"/>wie wir dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Abbtzeller</unclear></persName>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> gestatten wurden, wenn
<lb n="39"/>er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welte</unclear> von seinen ver-
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sprechen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abweichen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nit</unclear>
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zweiflende</unclear> der Herr werde den
<lb n="42"/><persName resp="#ner">Vechwyler</persName> hierinn in
<lb n="43"/>günstig bevelch halten, gstalten er
<lb n="44"/>Ursach haben, sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diser</unclear>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gutem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemeinten</unclear>
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürschrift</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">züerfreüwen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dar</unclear>-
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zürümen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ursach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werde</unclear>.
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sindt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Herren</unclear>
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fählen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zürwideren</unclear> willig
<lb n="50"/>enerbietig, uns damit beid-
<lb n="51"/>seits göttlich gnaden wolbefelende.
<lb n="52"/>Dat. <origDate when="1622-12-14" resp="#ner">den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">9</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">14</unclear>. Decembris. 1622.</origDate>
<lb n="53"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und rath
<lb n="54"/>der statt Sant Gallen</orgName>.
<lb n="55"/>Dem frommen, ehrenvesten und weisen
<lb n="56"/>Herren <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Hannß Jacob Heideggern</persName> deß raths
<lb n="57"/>zü <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-32" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Zürich</placeName> und der zeit Vogt der herschaft
<lb n="58"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-180" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Kyburg</placeName>, unserem besonders lieben herren
<lb n="59"/>güten freünd und Eydtgnossen.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2378_9119.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="60"/>Unsern freündtlichen grueß und geneigten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willen</unclear>
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fromm</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eersam</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> weise, besonnders
<lb n="62"/>liebe herren guete freündt und <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidtgnoßen</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>.
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Demnach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mitangehöriger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burger</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsell</unclear>
<lb n="64"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Othmar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Abbenzeller</unclear></persName> vor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeits</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear>-
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schinenheit</unclear> vor uns erschinen, sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erclagende</unclear>,
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waßmaßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> von dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwerigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßzuege</unclear>-
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hörigen</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hannßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schuefelberger</unclear></persName> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-102" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Heltßwilen</placeName>
<lb n="68"/>bewüßten kouffs halben, so gar khein satis-
<lb n="69"/>faction erlangen moege, und derowegen uns
<lb n="70"/>umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">intercession</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getreüwen</unclear>
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidtgnoßen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear> und Rhat
<lb n="72"/>der statt Zürich</orgName>, als der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">enden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hohe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oberkheit</unclear>,
<lb n="73"/>underthenig gebetten, so wir ihme burgerlicher
<lb n="74"/>verwandtnus halben, uf sein uns deßhalb
<lb n="75"/>eingelegte supplication, nit verweigeren könden,
<lb n="76"/>sonder ihme dieselbe ußfertigen laßen etc.,
<lb n="77"/>die er auch vor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochgedachten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrengemelten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">m</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">g</unclear>.
<lb n="78"/>herren, und obren eingelegt, unnd dieselben
<lb n="79"/>umb hilff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeflehet</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">was</unclear>
<lb n="80"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mir</unclear> nun hierüber von denselben meinen herren
<lb n="81"/>und Obern, uß mit ernst zuegeschriben worden,
<lb n="82"/>namlich daß dieweil <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">disere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kouffsabhand</unclear>-
<lb n="83"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußgemachte</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verrechtfertigte</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="84"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angelekte</unclear> sach seije, daß ihr deßhalben
<lb n="85"/>dahero den vilgedachten <persName resp="#ner">Hannßen Schuefelberger</persName>
<lb n="86"/>von oberkheit wegen und mit ernst dahin halten
<lb n="87"/>und vermoegen sollid, daß derselbig nit allein
<lb n="88"/>die voll fähl ohne weiteren umbtrib alhie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear>
<lb n="89"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bezhale</unclear>, sonders gesagtem <persName resp="#ner">Abbenzeller</persName>
<lb n="90"/>auch umb den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versprochnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kouffschilling</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sampt</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2378_9120.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="91"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebürenden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">billichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kosten</unclear>, darzu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihne</unclear>
<lb n="92"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrbefuegter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mutwilligerwiß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verursacht</unclear>,
<lb n="93"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begerlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlengterem</unclear> willen
<lb n="94"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haette</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alles</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdet</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> wol ein-
<lb n="95"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gedenck</unclear> sein. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nun</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwiflet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear>
<lb n="96"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">keins</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wegs</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> ihr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihne</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schuechlberger</unclear></persName>, mit
<lb n="97"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">usßerm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sententz</unclear>
<lb n="98"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehorsamliche</unclear> statt zethun, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">exequiert</unclear> haben. wir
<lb n="99"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">koennen</unclear> aber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bergen</unclear>, daß der
<lb n="100"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unserige</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Othmar</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Abbenzeller</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hüt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dato</unclear>
<lb n="101"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wieder</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> uns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erschienen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> sich
