<lb n="103"/>daß ob wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schuechlberger</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bij</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ehr</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="104"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angelobt</unclear>, sich in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herohe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zustellen</unclear>, und
<lb n="105"/>die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuldigkait</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeerstatten</unclear>, so habe er
