<lb n="120"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gehabt</unclear>, die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">roß</unclear> von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">neüwem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schetzen</unclear> zu-
